# AirSense AI Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# - Development: Set to '/api' (routes through Vite proxy to http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# - Production with Reverse Proxy: Set to '/api' (Nginx/Caddy proxying to FastAPI)
# - Production standalone: Set to 'https://api.airsense.ai/api'
VITE_API_BASE_URL="/api"
